' CPD-3402: unknown command or a command used where it cannot be
'expect: CPD-3402
r = $Bogus{x @ x = 1 : 2}

' $Plot must stand on its own line
'expect: CPD-3402
y = $Plot{x @ x = 0 : 1}

' A plot command without the @ part
'expect: CPD-3402
p = $Plot{x^2 x = 0 : 1}

' In a custom function body
'expect: CPD-3402
f(n) = $Summ{k @ k = 1 : n}
